.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBMediaRow\fR: one row of a music, podcast, video or file list. A flat, rounded, whole\-row button holding a picture, a title with a subtitle, optional extra columns, and a trailing part (a time, a menu). Together with \fBVirtualList\fR and a \fBSortHeader\fR it is the list component.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBRegular\fR: picture, then the title over its subtitle. The title column \fBgrows\fR (\fBflex\-grow: 1\fR): it covers all the width the picture, the extra columns and the suffix leave, so give the other columns fixed widths.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBCompact\fR (\fBcompact\fR): no picture, and the title and subtitle share the line, each in its own column, for dense lists.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBcolumn\fR adds a cell of a given width (an album, a BPM, a time); \fBsuffix\fR adds the trailing part (a menu button).
.PP
The whole row is the target, rounded, with a hover that reads on a plain page (\fBstyle::button::flat_row\fR).
.PP
.nf
.RS
MediaRow::new(&track.title)
    .subtitle(&track.artist)
    .picture(cover(track.id, 40.0))
    .column(Length::Fixed(160.0), caption(&track.album))
    .column(Length::Fixed(44.0), caption(track.time()))
    .suffix(menu_button(Icon::ViewMore, menu))
    .on_press(Msg::Play(track.id))
.RE
.fi
